<title>USA: Omaha hogs steady/off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs steady/off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were steady to $0.50 lower, trading was uneven. Top $57.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    230-260 lbs    57.00</p>
<p>    US 2-3    260-280 lbs    56.00-56.50, instance 57.00</p>
<p>Sows - uneven, steady. Top $48.50.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    350-450 lbs    44.00</p>
<p>		  450-500 lbs    46.00</p>
</text>
